# Order: Nethergarde -> Booty Bay (hearth) -> north loop (naga, gorillas, Unbagwa, Zanzil's ruins, Skullsplitter tusks) ->
# Booty Bay -> Wild Shore -> Booty Bay -> bottle, Jaguero Isle, the three ships and the level 50 grind -> Booty Bay -> Ratchet boat.
